(A) expansion of Re(R_tau - S_tau)
  [tau^0] residual: 0
  [tau^1] residual: 0
  [tau^2] residual: 0
  [tau^3] residual: 0
(B) Laurent extraction
  [tau^-2]  J - C^2X^2 : 0    J - J^Gamma : 0
  [tau^-1]  J - C^2X^2 : 0    J - J^Gamma : 0
  [tau^0]  J - C^2X^2 : 0    J - J^Gamma : 0
  [tau^1]  J - C^2X^2 : 2*sigma + 2*pi**2*u - 8*pi**2*log(2) + 7*zeta(3)    J - J^Gamma : 2*sigma + 2*pi**2*u - 8*pi**2*log(2) + 28*zeta(3)
  K2 (spectral subtraction, -AU/4 included) = -log(2**(28*zeta(3))) + 32*Catalan**2   residual: 0
  K2 (definition, J^Gamma subtraction)      = -log(2**(28*zeta(3))) + 32*Catalan**2   residual: 0
  [tau^2] C^2X^2 / 4 = 2*(zeta(3) + 64*log(2)**3/3)*log(2)  ;  [tau^2] J^Gamma / 4 = log(2**(-12*zeta(3) + 128*log(2)**3/3))
  ([tau^2]J^Gamma - [tau^2]C^2X^2)/4 = -14*log(2)*zeta(3)   (expect AU/4 = -14 zeta3 log2)
  before substitution, (1/4)[tau^2](J - J^G) = 4*sigma*log(2) + pi**2*u**2/4 + pi**2*v/2 + w/2 - 8*pi**2*log(2)**2 + pi**4/12 + 28*log(2)*zeta(3)
